<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/29/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The bank Kerjasama Rakyat Malaysia berhad (Special Provisions) 1978 [Act 202], which is referred to as the “principal act” in this act, is amended in section 2 by inserting after the definition of “Chairman” the following definition: ‘ “Commission” means the Malaysia Co-operative Societies Commission established under the Malaysia Co-operative Commission act 2007 [Act 665];’. BI.indd 1 Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/29/eng@> .
